SE`.\n- Document that `Verified` must reach MAX and carries across `NO_CODE_CHANGE` and `TRIVIAL_REBASE`, but not `MERGE_FIRST_PARENT_UPDATE`.\n- Document that both label functions use `NoBlock` while submit requirements enforce both votes. The `LLM-Review` requirement also rejects unresolved comments.\n- Document `rebase if necessary` as the submit action.\n- Preserve Gerrit-only merging and rollback procedures.\n- Make no service setting changes.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] `infra/runbooks/github-mirror-lock.md` states that GitHub Actions remains enabled and supplies Verified.\n- [x] `infra/runbooks/github-mirror-lock.md` states that GitHub Issues is disabled and that future integration is planned but unavailable.\n- [x] Runbook descriptions of both labels and their submit requirements match `infra/gerrit/project.config`.\n- [x] Runbook descriptions of each label copy condition match `infra/gerrit/project.config`.\n- [x] Submit guidance reflects the `rebase if necessary` action in `infra/gerrit/project.config`.\n- [x] Gerrit-only merging and rollback procedures remain intact.\n- [x] Only `infra/runbooks/github-mirror-lock.md`, `docs/gerrit-aws-setup.md`, and `infra/runbooks/two-vote-gate-rollback.md` change.\n- [x] Focused documentation, ADR, link, and whitespace checks pass. The full local test suite is skipped.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Compare the edited guidance with the `LLM-Review`, `Verified`, submit-requirement, and submit sections of `infra/gerrit/project.config`.\n- Run the focused documentation, ADR, link, and whitespace checks used by the repository.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/runbooks/github-mirror-lock.md","reason":"Correct the current Actions and Issues posture."},{"path":"docs/gerrit-aws-setup.md","reason":"Document the active two-vote and submit configuration."},{"path":"infra/runbooks/two-vote-gate-rollback.md","reason":"Correct active enforcement, vote carry, and rollback guidance."}],"fil